Section 7. That the Clerk of the Board is hereby directed to deliver a certified copy of this
Resolution to the Riverside County Registrar of Voters and the San Bernardino County Registrar of
Voters no later than August 7, 2026.
Section 8. That the Bonds may be issued pursuant to Education Code Section 15264 et
seq. or Government Code Section 53506. The maximum rate of interest on any Bond shall not exceed
